      "commitment": "The renderer-neutral workspace state, the scene primitive contract, and the Cesium primitive adapter keep their shape through `@honua/app-platform` 0.1.x: exports are not renamed or removed, primitive discriminants and diagnostic codes are additive only, and Cesium stays a lazily imported optional peer. Breaking one of those requires a minor bump and a called-out change, not a silent edit.",
